{"number":36,"title":"1 on 0 Quick-Up Timing","category":"Passing / Puck Movement","kind":"drill","source":"Weiss Advanced Vol 1","source_page":25,"description":"1. On the whistle, Player 1 takes a shot on the G. 2. Player 2 does a mohawk turn to the boards as Player 1 picks up a new puck in the corner. 3. Player 1 makes a pass to Player 2 for a shot on the G. 4. The drill continues with Player 2 picking up a new puck in the corner and making a pass to Player 3.","uid":"team-36","image":"data:image/webp;base64,"}